{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
* From the Hebrew word [[הר מגידו]] (''har megiddo''), used in [http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Bible_%28World_English%29/Revelation#Chapter_16 Revelation 16:16], referring to [[w:Tel Megiddo|Mount Megiddo]], the place of the last battle at the [[w:Last Judgment|Last Judgment]].

===Pronunciation===
* Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɛdən|-ɛdən]]

===Hyphenation===
Ar·ma·ged·don

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The place where the final battle will be fought between the forces of [[good]] and [[evil]].
# The scene of a decisive conflict on a great scale.
# Any great and crucial conflict.

